{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "ad781eb84ebeaf495b9fb3fd0688d40119cb972318dfb090f23fc8c98de89c95", "ja": "それぞれの青春", "zh": "各自的青春", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "afb6f83c865a40ce6f55693f70245c2dc187ade3f8469a64733e2219f3f86add", "ja": "Cleaskyのドラマに出演した真、茜、\nまつりがゲストに登場！　3人のお悩みに、\n見事に答えていく美也とエレナ。茜は出番の\n短さに不満げだったが、ひとまず次のお悩み\n相談へ。", "zh": "出演了Cleasky电视剧的真、茜、\n茉莉作为嘉宾登场！美也和艾莲娜\n精彩地解答了3人的烦恼。尽管茜对于\n戏份太短有些不满，但还是先进入下一个\n烦恼咨询。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "091b05a8ca4f77c9527c2edd9010285cd25c29be70812e8233ede59ab2520705", "ja": "お～、なんと～。ここで、\nゲストのみなさんが来てくれましたよ～。", "zh": "哦～，真是没想到～。这时候，  \n嘉宾们来啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "972423a5875e23cdaa2169dcb1fabb0ed26441b2a5186c368ac7a25c9ea3e19e", "ja": "ゲストはもちろん、\nワタシたちのドラマにも出演してた、この3人だヨ！", "zh": "嘉宾当然就是这3位也出演过我们电视剧的嘉宾啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "d49b480f8341d5df80866697bb926fd79339dec1fcfa9fe83b4638420618b436", "ja": "みんな、こんにちはー！\n菊地真です！　今日はよろしくね！", "zh": "大家，你好——！\n我是菊地真！今天请多关照啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "559dc88899085dccbe915d0b588d281eef3f85a0ae7427e4bc0756e4dc7ab7b5", "ja": "そしてそして、野々原茜ちゃんだよ～！\nみんな、盛り上がってるー！？", "zh": "接下来是野野原小茜哦～！\n大家，气氛热烈吗——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "748864a944a386b603b0f9d9c443adbcc1918620c7532a70a301b9d6b01dee9b", "ja": "はいほー！　徳川まつりなのです！\n姫と一緒に、わんだほー！な時間を過ごしましょー！", "zh": "嗨哟——！　德川茉莉哦！和公主一起度过超棒的时光吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "9b7c59bb38266fb484327e07e5e24a836f92a81ed1060c4cf67e2585c344bd3c", "ja": "さて～。せっかくゲストに来ていただいたので、\nみなさんのお悩みも、解決していきたいと思います～。", "zh": "那么～既然难得邀请到了嘉宾，\n也想帮大家解决烦恼呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "5256168aab69037eb4c92ba51f1ad7a9cf98da4d73c5cda417f29321be33a001", "ja": "あっ、それいいね！　ボク、ちょうど\n悩んでることがあってさ……。", "zh": "啊，这个主意不错！我正好\n有件烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "79943f85c3bfc7264c7b09c797b58842dcbbb389c99b07a56a2ae49ebc69e49d", "ja": "ホント？　ワタシたちでよければ\n何でも聞くヨ！", "zh": "真的吗？只要是我们能帮上忙的，什么都可以问哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "c348f1bb2d2eadb724ab821bad7611e1500d50f76fca0d84b9976c5263a1196e", "ja": "実は、この間読んだ少女漫画の続きが気になって、\n夜も眠れないんだよね……。どうすればいいかな？", "zh": "其实，我一直在意前阵子看的少女漫画的后续，\n晚上都睡不着觉了呢……该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "87726502b96f3109eb799490756327f791ab13c664d5039cbc2b9bc9d0460c18", "ja": "むむ～、それは困りましたね～……。", "zh": "唔唔～，这可真是伤脑筋呢～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "abf71585748bb7c415300ccd877c5edcb0277b86c313206c71599a17b1e4e3d1", "ja": "あ、夜に眠れないなら、お昼寝はどうでしょう～？\nポカポカお日様の下なら、きっとぐっすり眠れますよ♪", "zh": "啊，要是晚上睡不着的话，午睡怎么样呢～？\n在暖洋洋的阳光下，一定能睡得很香哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "2aa47f0fa25fab98e564b82b72a0493e10a5c0455cd5653ff21bc2a0baad4260", "ja": "なるほど、お昼寝かー。\nその手があったね！", "zh": "原来如此，午睡啊——\n还有这个办法呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "69b058229d2970a02607691da546517c574da2d684b56a7627e48c0cfc5fdc99", "ja": "ワタシだったら、サンバを踊るヨ！\n体が疲れて、眠れるカモ！", "zh": "如果是我的话，我会跳桑巴哦！\n身体累了，说不定就能睡着了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "dcab1d6114a17329f9f6103b2e0142c33b42a00eba92b8f7326574504436f01c", "ja": "あはは、それもいいね！　試してみるよ！\nふたりとも、ありがとう！", "zh": "啊哈哈，这主意也不错呢！我去试试看！\n谢谢你们两位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "3f57a57af4a2f514410a5a7a17fb6ea6371198598e546f92f2c04cb9432d23c8", "ja": "はいはーい！　茜ちゃんも、お悩みがありまーす！", "zh": "好嘞好嘞！小茜也有烦恼哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ade6a74e7b91005a4084acca39aaf49642d563d30bc19783ca0c07d07b5c88d", "ja": "ワオ！　アカネもあるノ？\nどんなお悩み？", "zh": "哇哦！茜也有烦恼吗？\n是什么烦恼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "36d500593f5808c820b822f8128719a9c84be489d59a375d3264109b85df0cab", "ja": "あのね、茜ちゃんちの冷蔵庫には、\n今ふたつのプリンがあるんだ……。", "zh": "我说啊，小茜家的冰箱里，\n现在放着两个布丁哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "26fec644a5a3545015892f377f9b9b929029a3e5bd55210a0cb7aeb056ddc975", "ja": "甘くて濃厚なキャラメルプリンと、オトナの味わいが\n楽しめる抹茶プリン。どっちを先に食べるべきかな！？", "zh": "香甜浓郁的焦糖布丁，还有能品味成熟风味的抹茶布丁。到底该先吃哪个呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "7748bbdfa749eb6815c3b2271b0f700aac4e033d144438064ab5d319d097b3fe", "ja": "む～ん、どちらもおいしそうですね～。\n私も、悩んでしまうと思います～。", "zh": "嗯～，两个看起来都很好吃呢～。\n换作是我，肯定也会很纠结的吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "8170a4f72288f00677d336a7bb223548f3910c351ac605c4d1daa59359090d7d", "ja": "ワタシもどっちも食べたいナ！　両方食べようヨ！\nってことで、アカネのお悩みは解決だネ♪", "zh": "我也两个都想吃！那就两个都吃吧！\n这样一来，茜的烦恼就解决啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "169221c9490cfe1562b5a7b9e8adc87365c4adfc474c19a4ffaaf2f0435e7471", "ja": "いやいや！\nどっちを先にっていうお悩みなんだけど！？", "zh": "不不不！\n烦恼的是先吃哪一个好不好！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "bbee9a4e9dd92ccbd8157f4a55c3c4fc97af943c3ca3cffb64bf1720bc8a799d", "ja": "最後は、まつりちゃんですね～。\n何かお悩みはありますか？", "zh": "最后是小祭呢～。\n有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "77ddcf7843b2a278731c025cf3cf6b0e2f8ab78eb5ef2929e5b84fa4c03f7e57", "ja": "もちろん、あるのです。姫は今までにない、\nオリジナルのマシュマロを作ってみたいのですけど……", "zh": "当然有了。公主想做一种前所未有的、\n独创的棉花糖，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "90b82f322bdd57dea8cafc7e89f845f8f0a6d3ccab7316f5282da21e2c6fc7d6", "ja": "どんな味にしようか迷っているのです。\nふたりは、何味がいいと思うのです？", "zh": "该做成什么口味才好呢，我正在犹豫。\n你们觉得做成什么口味好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "05d5f05a3f80c584261bd3f38b5ae479b2ae9aeedb2c4d692a10c22c508c9e52", "ja": "今までにないマシュマロですか～。\nそれでしたら……。", "zh": "是前所未有的棉花糖吗～  \n这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "b43a182fb659fd6906a69c327100caa6ec075199318f424a46894606ae9695f6", "ja": "最初は甘くて、次にすっぱさがあって……最後に、\n炭酸みたいにパチパチ弾けるのはどうでしょう～？", "zh": "先是甜甜的，接着有点酸……最后，\n像碳酸饮料一样噼里啪啦弹开，这样怎么样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "63da361ceea4711c13490193a4a8ba8c59b5341b9d634fc9343b98ef0b9b5df9", "ja": "ワタシは、フェジョアーダ味のマシュマロがいいと\n思うナ！　ブラジル料理のパッションを込めるんだヨ♪", "zh": "我觉得，做成巴西黑豆炖肉风味的棉花糖就很好！融入巴西料理的热情吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "0d8e5d68ff5dd5e8c752688542b1df0c73616626a2a346568ee9cf1528d364d2", "ja": "ふたりとも、わんだほー！なアイディアなのです！\n参考にさせてもらうのです♪", "zh": "你们两个的想法都棒极了！我会参考一下的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "05e3b35cb3ec7c317b7fe997a0e237b5ec5748e8b87a0579e1958191cc64bc7e", "ja": "おいしいかどうかはわからないけど……\nふたりらしいアイディアだね！", "zh": "虽然不知道好不好吃……\n但确实是很有你们两人风格的点子呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "04aa68279835c7b7cf421c584ada8ac48b891e1374d28423dfd389796a169216", "ja": "はいなのです♪\n作ったらぜひ、試食もお願いしたいのです！", "zh": "好的哟♪\n做好之后，也请务必让我们试吃一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "3cb53c989f444ab1b9b0353758b9f84b957a2178bdb564946b716eafc9043334", "ja": "わぁ、それは楽しみです～。というわけで、\nゲストのみなさんのお悩みも無事に解決しましたね～。", "zh": "哇～那可真令人期待呢～。这么一来，\n各位嘉宾的烦恼也都顺利解决啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_03_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "a4be806a55765fe750ff200a498c836aa583bd5812884f35c82ed789836a8d2f", "ja": "えっ、茜ちゃんのだけ解決してなくない！？", "zh": "诶，只有小茜的问题还没解决吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
